<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="750" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Ciutadella regular&quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: none; background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246);"><tbody><tr><td style="line-height: 20px; border: 0px; border-spacing: 0px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="680" style="text-align: center; border: 0px; border-spacing: 0px; padding: 0px;"><tbody><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tbody><tr width="680"><td align="center" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; text-align: center; height: 60px; width: 680px;"><div style="height: 15px; line-height: 15px;">&nbsp;</div><div style="height: 15px; line-height: 15px;">&nbsp;</div></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 680px;"><tbody><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tbody><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><a href="http://www.qantas.com/" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-decoration-line: none; border: 0px;"><img alt="Qantas" border="0" src="http://salesnews.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/2026710205/181022+qantas-header-brand-680x70.png" title="Qantas" width="680" style="display: block; width: 680px; height: 70px;"></a></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&nbsp;</td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table id="main-content" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="680" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: center;"><tbody><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">Dear &lt; AM to Insert personalisation &gt;,</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">I am happy to share with you that Qantas is continuing to help eligible Qantas Frequent Flyers to maintain their travel benefits. We’ve offered a range of support mechanisms for our members through the pandemic and we are now extending our support even further.</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">For Australian and New Zealand based members (whose status is due to expire in 2021) to maintain their Qantas Frequent Flyer status, they just need to book and pay for an eligible flight (on or after 23 November 2020 and before the end of their membership year for travel until the end of 2021) and we will extend their status, at its current level, for a further 12 months.</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">In addition, we’re giving eligible members a head start at reaching their status goals beyond 2022, by giving them the ability to rollover eligible Status Credits into their next membership year.</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">If your, or anyone in your team’s, status is due for review in 2021, we hope that you’ll be able to take advantage of the status extension and Status Credit rollover by booking an eligible flight.</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">For further details, please visit&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantas.com/statussupport" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border: 0px;">qantas.com/statussupport</a>.</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">We look forward to welcoming you onboard soon.</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">Kind regards,</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">{!User.FirstName} {!User.LastName}</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px; text-align: left; width: 600px; padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px;">{!User.Title}</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" st